{
 "id": "direct-jump",
 "order": 14,
 "name": "Direct Pattern Jump",
 "description": [
  "PATTERN, then FUNC + a trig key = the new pattern takes over within a step or two and plays on from the",
  "position the old one was at. A trig key alone = normal change at the end of the pattern.",
  "PATTERN latches the pattern selection: it stays open while you pick patterns or jump; only PATTERN closes it.",
  "Copying, pasting or clearing a pattern (trig + REC / STOP / PLAY) keeps the selection open."
 ],
